abstract: "Local-first control plane for the github.com/coasys repository fleet: clones and syncs repos, tracks freshness and CI metadata, auto-detects build/start/deploy commands across npm, Rust, Deno, Nix, Make and Holochain, and serves a SQLite-backed dashboard for dependency-ordered rollout."
